<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>Grit-2400 on eQualle Blog</title><link>https://blog.equalle.com/tags/grit-2400/</link><description>Recent posts on eQualle Blog</description><generator>Hugo 0.150.1</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 15:02:54 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.equalle.com/tags/grit-2400/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Finishing At 3000 Grit To Speed Polish</title><link>https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 15:02:51 +0000</pubDate><category>Grit Range &amp; Classification</category><category>grit-800</category><category>grit-2000</category><category>grit-2400</category><category>grit-3000</category><category>clear coat</category><category>resin casting</category><category>wet sanding</category><category>mirror finish</category><category>polishing pads</category><description>Learn how finishing at 3000-grit speeds polishing with clear steps, tool setup, and pro tips for metal, resin, and paint to reach gloss fast.</description><summary>&lt;h2 id="sandpaper-grit-3000-for-faster-polishing"&gt;Sandpaper grit 3000 for faster polishing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Saturday afternoon light angles across your workbench. There’s a piece you’ve been living with for weeks now—a motorcycle cover, a resin casting, maybe a metal panel from a restoration project—almost finished, not quite gleaming. You’ve already invested hours stepping through the paper stack, rinsing, wiping, inspecting. Still, the last 10% of the job feels like the last 90% of the effort. That’s where smart use of sandpaper grit, especially finishing at 3000, starts to feel less like a detail and more like a turning point. The moment a faint reflection becomes clear, the surface stops fighting you and starts cooperating.&lt;/p&gt;</summary><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/images/brand/01.webp" medium="image"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/instagram/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/instagram/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/instagram/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/pinterest/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/pinterest/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/pinterest/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><readingTime>12</readingTime></item><item><title>When To Sand Between Coats Of Water-Based Finish</title><link>https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Feb 2026 14:06:32 +0000</pubDate><category>Between-Coats Sanding</category><category>grit-320</category><category>grit-400</category><category>grit-600</category><category>grit-1500</category><category>grit-2400</category><category>orbital sander</category><category>grit progression</category><description>Learn exactly when and how to do between coats sanding on water-based finishes. Get pro-level timing, abrasive choices, and workflow for flawless results.</description><summary>&lt;h2 id="between-coats-sanding-for-water-based-finishes"&gt;between coats sanding for water-based finishes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The first time I chased a flawless water-based finish, I watched the light graze across a new maple desk and saw nothing but promise—and dust nibs. Under the shop’s afternoon sun, every tiny speck caught the eye. I had followed the schedule, measured film build, and kept a clean bench. But the finish felt slightly rough, like a fine orange peel. I knew what came next: between coats sanding. The question was not whether to sand, but when—and how—to avoid cutting through those early coats or, worse, clogging the abrasive with half-cured resin.&lt;/p&gt;</summary><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/images/brand/16.webp" medium="image"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/facebook/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/facebook/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/facebook/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/instagram/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/instagram/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/instagram/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/pinterest/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/pinterest/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/pinterest/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/facebook/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/facebook/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/02/06/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding/cards/facebook/when-to-sand-between-coats-of-water-based-finish-between-coats-sanding.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><readingTime>11</readingTime></item></channel></rss>